WEBVTT

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:03.006
While we wrongly dissipate our energies
fighting the wrong crises,

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.712
all those who invest in knowledge about us

00:03:05.736 --> 00:03:10.760
are busy figuring out
how to pipe water from Libya's aquifers

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.729
to quench Europe's thirst.

00:03:14.811 --> 00:03:17.184
Such is our knowledge
of our water resources

00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:19.340
that many of our countries have given up

00:03:19.364 --> 00:03:22.101
on making potable water a routine presence

00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:23.884
in the lives of Africans,

00:03:23.908 --> 00:03:25.563
rich or poor,

00:03:25.587 --> 00:03:27.042
high and low,

00:03:27.066 --> 00:03:28.496
rural and urban.

00:03:29.252 --> 00:03:32.722
We eagerly accept
what the merchants of misery